            <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-ink leading-tight mb-5">Trauma Therapy</h1>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">Trauma-focused therapy means working with a psychologist on the mark a difficult experience has left on your present life. The aim is not to forget what happened, but to reduce how much it decides about today. We work with children, adolescents, people in emerging adulthood and adults. Sessions are 45 minutes, in English or Turkish, in person or online.</p>
